{{DISPLAYTITLE: <span class="text-evolution";">Evolved Furnace</span>}}
{{Evolved Card Infobox|Cost=4|CycleCost=2|Rarity=Rare|Type=Troop|Arena=Hog Mountain|ReleaseDate=4 August 2025}}

{{Quote|All fired up! When it’s hot and attacking, Evolved Furnace summons Fire Spirits even faster from hat to hearth.}}

The Furnace's Evolution is a {{Rarity|Rare}} [[Cards|card]] that is unlocked with 6 Evolution Shards. It spawns a Furnace, with identical stats to the original. When the Furnace attacks, the spawn speed is decreased to 2.4sec, as well as spawn [[Fire Spirit|Fire Spirits]] to the side, instead of the front. It appears to be an amethyst cast-iron steam locomotive armor with golden spikes, limbs, and a [[Card Evolution]] symbol in the center, wearing purple gloves ane cape with golden linings, team-colored chainmail, a cracked metal witch-like hat on top with a golden band in the middle, and a golden grate in the center. It also holds a wooden staff with a cauldron placed on top that has a golden handle filled with bubbling magenta fluid in it, which resembles Elixir, along with a large amethyst knob on the bottom with golden spikes on it. The Furnace's Evolution costs 4 [[Elixir]] and requires 2 cycles to deploy.

==Strategy==
*Make sure that the Furnace attacks as much as possible, so that it spawns as many as possible.
*The Fire Spirit from "Hot Spawns" ability spawn first to the left, then to the right, then to the left again, and so on.
**This can be used to lure units from the other side of the [[Arenas|arena]].
*The [[Rage]] works really well, to spawn even more Fire Spirits.

